    {
      "subId": "7006904",
      "subQuestName": "(test) Discarded",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700671501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700671501": {
            "id": "700671501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "Venipi! Dex! And Raumhilda and our new friends! Thank you all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671502"
            ]
          },
          "700671502": {
            "id": "700671502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "...I'm her younger sister Zeitlind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671503"
            ]
          },
          "700671503": {
            "id": "700671503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "I see. The two of you look so much alike, and oh so pretty. My name is Kshama, and I come from... Ah, what was I going to say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671504"
            ]
          },
          "700671504": {
            "id": "700671504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "I see. The two of you look so much alike, and oh so pretty. My name is Kshama, and I come from Greater Lord Rukkhadevata's era.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671505"
            ]
          },
          "700671505": {
            "id": "700671505",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "The era in which the Dendro Archon had yet to become a child.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671506"
            ]
          },
          "700671506": {
            "id": "700671506",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Venipi introduces Kshama, and Vitruvius's tragic circumstances are revealed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671507"
            ]
          },
          "700671507": {
            "id": "700671507",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "They also speak of the epitaph he took thousands of years to come up with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671508"
            ]
          },
          "700671508": {
            "id": "700671508",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "That is beyond absurd.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671509"
            ]
          },
          "700671509": {
            "id": "700671509",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "If I hadn't told you, you would never have known.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671510"
            ]
          },
          "700671510": {
            "id": "700671510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "Now that you have, it's going to be hard for me to look Vitruvius in the eye without laughing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671511"
            ]
          },
          "700671511": {
            "id": "700671511",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "Alright, enough small talk. We've come all this way, and it doesn't look like we've missed anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671512"
            ]
          },
          "700671512": {
            "id": "700671512",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "Is there anyone else?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671513"
            ]
          },
          "700671513": {
            "id": "700671513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "I'm afraid not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671514"
            ]
          },
          "700671514": {
            "id": "700671514",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "Then how about how we can stop folks from turning into sand? Any ideas?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671515"
            ]
          },
          "700671515": {
            "id": "700671515",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "We didn't manage to learn much from exploring earlier. After all, no one here at the Desert Pavilion is well-versed in the mystic arts or the sciences.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671516"
            ]
          },
          "700671516": {
            "id": "700671516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "So, it seems we're back to the only known method: defeating the Punisher of Gomorrah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671517"
            ]
          },
          "700671517": {
            "id": "700671517",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "#That you need not worry about. We have {NICKNAME}, who has the strength of a Remurian Tribune.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671518"
            ]
          },
          "700671518": {
            "id": "700671518",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Zeitlind",
            "text": "Looks like someone's been promoted again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671519"
            ]
          },
          "700671519": {
            "id": "700671519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "But there's no way to find the Punisher of Gomorrah. It has hidden its form.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671520"
            ]
          },
          "700671520": {
            "id": "700671520",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "That is a problem, yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671521"
            ]
          },
          "700671521": {
            "id": "700671521",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You know, it wasn't easy getting everyone out. How about we leave this place first and get back to the main hall?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671522"
            ]
          },
          "700671522": {
            "id": "700671522",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Istoria and Josephus are there too. They seem rather knowledgeable, so maybe they know a way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671523"
            ]
          },
          "700671523": {
            "id": "700671523",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "Oh, Istoria's safe too? That's really good to know. He's the most experienced of us all, and is always open to learning new things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671524"
            ]
          },
          "700671524": {
            "id": "700671524",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Kshama",
            "text": "If we're talking about anecdotes, history, and culture, he's probably the most knowledgeable person in this world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700671525"
            ]
          },
          "700671525": {
            "id": "700671525",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Venipi",
            "text": "Then let's go now. The earlier we get back, the earlier we can figure this out and save Vitruvius and the rest!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}